message: "If you use this software or data, please cite as below."
type: software
title: "calion: District Heating Dispatch Optimization Framework"
abstract: >
  Code and data package for 'Topology Abstraction and Physics Fidelity Effects
  on Dispatch Optimization of Electrified District Heating Networks'.
  Model levels (copperplate to nonlinear reference) implemented in Pyomo/Gurobi,
  validated against industrial operational data.
  v1.2.0 (2026-08-12) accompanies the Applied Energy major revision: estimation bias
  vs decision regret, an exact loss/topology/interaction decomposition, an a-priori
  fidelity design rule b=lambda/(1+lambda), and a directly solved temperature-linearisation
  reference on representative windows. Built on the v1.1.0 corrected model (commit c19d690).
  See CHANGELOG.md and SOLVED_LINEARISATION_ANALYSIS.md.
